WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue { background-color: rgba(247,241,227,0.92); color:#28241E; font-family:"Lexend","Atkinson Hyperlegible",sans-serif; line-height:1.4; font-size:140%; font-weight:600; }

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.273
These are Mind Maps. A mind map

00:00:03.303 --> 00:00:05.650
turns your ideas into a picture.

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:09.090
Paste your own paragraph here,

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:14.310
and Nibras builds the whole map from it.

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:17.410
Make it bigger or smaller,

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:23.050
colour its parts, and add or remove branches.

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:33.730
Then download it to your device to print.

00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:38.030
Your ideas, as a map you can explore.
